    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="praat" PARTICIPANT="Diana Bell" TIER_ID="Diana Bell">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts6" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts8">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Diana Clifton Bell.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts10" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts12">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I attended the University of Florida uh from 1967 to 1969 as a undergrad.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts13" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts14">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I returned in 71, I received a master’s in 72.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a4"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts16" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts18">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh. As an undergrad, I majored in Language Arts—English, as we called it then— Education, and my master’s program um involved Special Education.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts19" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts20">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh. I received a master’s in Mental Retardation.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a6"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts22" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts24">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes. I was a teacher.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a7"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts28" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts30">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I’m from Daytona Beach, Florida.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a8"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts32" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts34">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a9"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts36" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts38">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn’t go uh back immediately, but eventually I went back.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a10"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts42" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts44">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, uh, yes. Uh I-I got my —well, I did my undergrad in—well, I came here as a junior college transfer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a11"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts46" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts48">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>From Daytona Beach.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a12"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts49" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts50">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I went to uh Daytona Beach Junior College at the time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a13"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts51" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts52">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I came here as a junior in- in 67, and I graduated in 69.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a14"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts56" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts58">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um as- in general, the late 60s was um a very um, shall I say turbulent time in our history?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a15"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts59" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts61">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um a time of social unrest um, um, a lot with the new uh era of thinking in terms of the whole free love scene, and the-the uh drug culture, and of course uh Civil Rights was a very big thing uh for me, being an African American— and in fact for the country, because it meant a lot um of changes, and a great challenge for the country.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a16"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts64" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts66">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well um, at the University of Florida uh, there were a lot of activities, most of which I felt uh excluded from ?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a17"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts68" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts70">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The sororities.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a18"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts72" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts74">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um uh...and just, there were no organizations that I received invitations to join.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a19"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts75" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts76">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um but I really wasn’t worried about it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a20"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts77" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts78">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um and I didn’t seek to join.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a21"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts79" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts81">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I think I was a little bit sensitive, and I felt like, “Okay, you’re going there, you going to get an education, and you’re not going to really worry about pushing the envelope.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a22"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts82" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts84">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know, just do what you have to do.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a23"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts85" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts86">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But uh I must say uh, it was a very pleasant experience for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a24"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts87" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts88">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um uh I came as the daughter of two parents who had not finished high school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a25"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts89" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts90">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I was the oldest in my family .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a26"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts91" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts92">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I had relatives here, and I was happy to be here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a27"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts94" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts96">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, yes. And I was happy to be here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a28"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts97" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts98">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So. Um you know, even though I felt like things were not exactly open to me, I was not unhappy about it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a29"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts99" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts100">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I uh was um a member of a very small group of Black students that were here at the time, and we set about creating a place for ourselves, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a30"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts101" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts102">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um and we uh established the first Black Student Union um in my junior year, my first year here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a31"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts103" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts104">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And that was something that um I became very involved in, um bringing um national Black figures here to speak to uh the city and students about issues that were coming up.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a32"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts106" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts108">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Adam Clayton Powell.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a33"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts109" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts110">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And um I believe um um... Muhammad Ali.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a34"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts111" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts112">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I believe-I believe I remember him coming.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a35"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts113" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts114">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He was just getting started with the boxing and everything.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a36"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts116" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts118">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a37"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts120" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts122">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I remember it was, it was fascinating.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a38"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts124" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts126">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, he was pretty .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a39"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts127" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts128">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And he was talking to— both—</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a40"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts130" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts132">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. Yeah, and at the time, he wasn't-he hadn’t become uh really uh known for his defiance of the things that he saw you know as immoral.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a41"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts133" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts134">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But he was just starting his career .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a42"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts135" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts136">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He was loud, and he was promoting himself.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a43"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts137" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts138">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But um he was still a figure that was saying something, and someone to- that you wanted to know, “What is this person all about ?”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a44"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts139" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts140">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I think Adam Clayton Powell was the most prominent people-person that I remember.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a45"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts141" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts142">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I -um I was, so I think I was more of a voyeur uh on the campus scene in terms of all the things that were happening, the sit-in at Tigert Hall, or the takeover of Tigert Hall by the Black students</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a46"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts144" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts146">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>—my senior year.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a47"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts147" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts148">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um well, they-they felt that-that Tigert was not responsive to the needs of Black students .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a48"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts149" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts150">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And um so, they were going to sit in until certain demands were made .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a49"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts151" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts152">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I-I don’t remember exactly what all the demands were, but I believe that uh establishing um Black um- Black culture courses um were—that-I-I think that was a part of the demand, to have some um Black history, or African—</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a50"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts154" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts156">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn’t participate .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a51"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts158" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts160">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn't participate and that was-that was um heavy on my mind, because I was not —of course I was sympathetic .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a52"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts161" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts162">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But by the same token, I felt like I couldn’t afford to put myself in a position to be thrown out of school, because so much was riding on me in terms of my family’s expectations.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a53"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts163" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts164">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so it was hard, it was hard for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a54"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts165" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts166">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was very hard.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a55"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts172" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts174">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, before I came, I received a lot of scary stories about how, “Oh, the courses are so hard; you’re not prepared; you’re going to fail ; blah blah blah blah blah blah. ”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a56"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts175" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts176">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But um I had come from a um segregated school .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a57"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts177" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts178">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um the whole system from grade one through twelve, I’d been with only Black kids.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a58"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts179" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts180">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I had gone to junior college, where I was always only-the only Black student in there, but I had been raised in that segregated situation to think that I was very special.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a59"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts181" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts182">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And that I was the cat’s meow, that I was-I was somebody !</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a60"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts183" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts184">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, I really didn’t feel intimidated by what I was told.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a61"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts185" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts186">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I said—</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a62"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts188" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts190">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Just other Black people, people in general.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a63"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts191" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts192">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I don’t know where they received their information from, but they felt like—well they felt like,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a64"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts193" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts194">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>okay, they felt like my education was inferior because it was separate.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a65"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts195" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts196">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And you know you used to get the old books, and-and really not a lot of financial support —not as much you know in terms of materials and all that as the other- as the predominantly White schools.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a66"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts197" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts198">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So therefore, everyone concluded that the education was inferior.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a67"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts202">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>These were mostly Black- mostly Black people telling me this.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a68"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts204" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts206">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The teachers always told me I could do whatever I wanted to do.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a69"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts207" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts208">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But people just in the community felt like, “Oh, okay” —and I think they basically felt that because it was an all -White institution— that when I went in, I would be ostracized, I would be treated negatively, I would fail, I couldn’t measure up.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a70"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts209" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts210">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I never bought into it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a71"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts211" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts212">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I said, “Well, we’ll see. ”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a72"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts213" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts214">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, when I came, I really came with a lot of confidence and I-I never had any problems whatsoever.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a73"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts215" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts216">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And even though I didn't feel a part of the social scene after class, like I said it didn't really bother me although I could see it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a74"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts217" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts218">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um you know I did- I did fine in my classes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a75"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts219" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts220">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know I-I wasn't the A student, but then I didn't work as hard as I could have.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a76"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts221" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts222">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I just-I did-I did a little bit more partying than I should have, you know? So um-so I-I did, you know I did pretty well.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a77"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts223" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts224">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And um I enjoyed my stay. And I was close to home- I could go home whenever I wanted.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a78"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts225" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts226">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I had family in the community, so I could visit them as much as I wanted and- and it was a fine mix for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a79"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts227" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts228">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh now, there's something that I experienced that I think was unique to my um generation the um housing situation.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a80"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts229" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts230">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In the dormitory. Um there were three of us black girls in Rawlings Hall.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a81"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts231" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts233">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>One girl disclaimed being Black she-well she say she was a Puerto Rican.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a82"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts234" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts236">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So we said okay. So we used to call her the Black Puerto Rican. But that was an inside joke.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a83"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts237" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts238">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um my roommate um who at first had her own room and I had my own room.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a84"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts239" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts240">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We didn't have roommates. All the other girls had roommates.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a85"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts241" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts242">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>At first we were all separate.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a86"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts243" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts244">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um the girl from Ocala Frankie Crosky and I met and decided we were going to become roommates and so second semester we petitioned to live together and so we did for that first year.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a87"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts245" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts246">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um if you-okay in the dormitory, no boys could come upstairs. They could only meet you downstairs in the um reception area. So you had a buzzer and they would buzz your room and tell you that such and such was down for you in the lobby.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a88"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts247" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts248">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So you'd have to walk down and receive them there and if- you know- if you went off, fine.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a89"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts249" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts250">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If you went off campus, you had to be back by, I believe it was 12 o' clock.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a90"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts251" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts252">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If you weren't going to come back you had to sign out to some place in particular.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a91"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts253" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts254">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh that was my junior year. My senior year- seniors were given a key.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a92"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts255" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts256">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That was the first experimental year where they were given a key .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a93"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts257" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts258">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They could come in any time they wanted, and they could let themselves in the locked dormitory with their key, but they could not let anyone else in with their key.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a94"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts259" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts260">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, that’s when they first started to experiment with giving more freedom.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a95"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts261" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts262">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh if you were a junior, you still had to check out, and you used to had to— otherwise be in by twelve .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a96"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts263" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts264">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I’m not sure when they stopped that, because I graduated in 69.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a97"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts265" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts266">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know, and when I came back, I wasn’t in the dormitories.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a98"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts267" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts268">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I think that was kind of unique, because when my daughter was here in 90-um, she came in 91, graduated in 95, the boys could come in; I know there were boys that spent the night.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a99"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts269" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts270">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh I can remember going into the restroom, and a boy meeting me coming out, and I’m going, “Whoa!”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a100"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts272" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts274">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>A lot of changes, very co-ed, very co-ed!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a101"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts275" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts276">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So that was, like, shocking to me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a102"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts277" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts278">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That was really interesting.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a103"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts282" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts284">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a104"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts286" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts288">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well see, as a graduate student, you’re in a different world.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a105"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts290" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts292">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I was not in touch with people who lived in dormitories, or-or really in touch with anyone that wasn’t in my department.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a106"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts293" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts294">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, I was married by then, um and just living in a- a different world altogether.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a107"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts296" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts298">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was full time, because I- I had uh been a teacher for two years, and I- I came back that third year</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a108"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts299" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts300">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>um deciding that I needed more to teach the students that I had.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a109"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts301" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts302">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because um in English education we- we’d been given um an approach to teaching that worked very well with bright students, but more and more special needs students were emerging, and I felt like, “Okay, I need something else. ”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a110"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts304" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts306">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn’t say “White.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a111"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts310" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts312">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, special needs.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a112"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts314" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts316">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, bright!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a113"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts318" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts320">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Bright students. Bright students.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a114"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts322" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts324">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a115"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts325" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts326">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know, um analyzing uh poems, a lot of analytical kind of thing; um and through um- composition through analysis of character themes and that kind of stuff, which you still, it’s still doing in-in schools.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a116"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts327" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts328">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But there-there are different stratas of kids that had needs that were different from that .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a117"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts329" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts330">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I said, “Okay, what can I do to empower myself to-to gain additional skills to reach these students who are not there, but who are showing up in my class every day?”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a118"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts331" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts332">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, I got the idea to go back and uh get a degree in Special Education.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a119"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts333" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts334">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, that’s what um I received my master’s in.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a120"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts335" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts336">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, I don’t really know what the- the setting was.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a121"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts338" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts340">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, not- not at that point.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a122"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts341" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts342">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was just, you know uh deal with my husband, and deal with my-my courses, and that was- that was my focus.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a123"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts343" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts344">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a124"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts346" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts348">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>From high school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a125"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts354" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts356">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a126"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts357" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts358">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In my immediate family.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a127"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts359" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts360">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>However, I had three aunts who were teachers.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a128"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts361" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts362">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, they motivated me, you know—and my mom.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a129"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts363" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts364">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because my mom was a very smart lady despite the- the fact that she didn’t finish high school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a130"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts365" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts366">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Hers was more of a um… uh… I've- you know she got married early.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a131"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts367" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts368">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>My dad came back from the war, and she was being raised by her grandparents, and um she felt like, “Okay, I need to- I need to make some money to take of myself.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a132"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts369" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts371">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because it was hard times for the family in general.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a133"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts372" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts374">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And my father came back from the war, and you know they fell in love, and they got married.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a134"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts375" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts376">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, when he came back from the war, he uh wanted a trade.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a135"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts377" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts378">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then, uh it was- that was the big thing in Black families for the men to get trades, because they - the um—being a brick mason, or a carpenter and all that, paid some pretty good money.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a136"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts379" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts380">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know? And so, my father went to uh Bethune-Cookman College Trade School</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a137"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts382" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts384">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Bethune-Cookman College Trade School and um- on the GI Bill.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a138"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts385" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts386">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, he became um a brick mason, and later a subcontractor.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a139"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts387" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts388">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So for thirty-eight years, he built houses.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a140"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts389" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts390">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But my mom- my mom worked for uh a prominent White family in town, um keeping their house and their- their children.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a141"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts391" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts392">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so you know they made a very modest living.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a142"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts393" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts394">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They built our home.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a143"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts395" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts396">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I was one of four children.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a144"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts397" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts398">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They really preached education to all of us; however, I was the only one that went to college.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a145"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts399" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts400">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I thought I would be the beginning, but somewhere along the way, the others didn’t take to it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a146"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts401" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts402">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But you know I’ve always been highly motivated for education—</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a147"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts403" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts404">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a148"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts405" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts406">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And um I excelled you know coming through uh the different grades, and it just seemed like the normal progression for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a149"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts407" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts408">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a150"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts410" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts412">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Classes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a151"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts417" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts418">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Were the teachers encouraging?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a152"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts420" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts422">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, the teachers-teachers didn’t say anything to me personal.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a153"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts423" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts424">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was just, they taught their course.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a154"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts425" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts426">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know they didn’t say anything good or bad, just taught the content.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a155"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts427" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts428">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, my reinforcement pretty much came from my family.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a156"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts429" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts430">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And my um teachers through the years you know always told me I was special, um always told me I was smart.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a157"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts431" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts432">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I was an uh honors student, um honor society, um I was in the campus leadership, um was a part of the band as one of those little flag girl sort of things, kind of a half-majorette, half-flag girl—</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a158"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts434" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts436">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, no, no, that was at —</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a159"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts438" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts440">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In high school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a160"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts442" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts444">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In high school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a161"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts445" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts446">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I was involved with a lot things that-that gave me a lot of uh self-assurance.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a162"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts447" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts448">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, I think that helped me to uh to come here and and just deal with things the way things were.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a163"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts449" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts450">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I you know I love this place—I love Florida, I’m a Gator all the way.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a164"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts454" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts456">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um at first, I was thinking of going to Dillard in New Orleans, which is a Black school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a165"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts458" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts460">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Purely because I wanted to go to Mardi Gras.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a166"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts461" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts462">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>to what-do-you-call</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a167"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts463" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts464">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>from the pictures at Mardi Gras.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a168"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts465" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts466">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And my parents didn’t know, I don’t think so.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a169"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts468" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts470">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, they said- “That’s too far away, we don’t have uh the money to uh support you in that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a170"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts471" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts472">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We- we can’t you know bring you home for the holidays.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a171"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts473" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts474">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh it’s too far for us to send for you if you know if there’s an emergency or whatever.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a172"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts475" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts476">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We think it’s better if you go to junior college.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a173"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts477" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts478">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then, when you go to junior college, then you can go to one of the state schools, and that will be better for you and for us. ”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a174"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts479" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts480">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, you know after uh really uh putting up a big fuss, I lost.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a175"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts482" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts484">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah and you know what?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a176"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts485" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts486">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I’m happy about it, because you know I just- I think I got a really good experience at Florida.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a177"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts487" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts488">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um I have no regrets.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a178"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts489" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts490">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um it’s good.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a179"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts492" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts494">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um no uh—well, let’s see.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a180"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts495" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts496">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, you know I’m from Daytona, so there’s Bethune-Cookman there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a181"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts497" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts498">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But very few kids want to go school in their home town.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a182"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts499" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts500">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I wanted to get out of town, so.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a183"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts501" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts502">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um and I don’t know, Florida A&amp;M never uh interested me, although my friends- a lot- went to uh Florida A&amp;M, a lot of them went to Bethune, some of them went to, like, Spelman, and different colleges in Atlanta and Tennessee and</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a184"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts503" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts504">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>all those things, but I- I, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a185"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts505" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts506">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, I didn’t consider any of them .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a186"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts507" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts508">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But once I got- I was settled on the idea of junior college, and I said, “Hey, if I go to junior college,” I figured out, “then I can go to UF you know or FSU you know as a transfer student.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a187"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts509" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts510">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I said, “Okay, that’s good.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a188"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts511" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts512">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I knew that my aunt was- I knew that my aunt was over here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a189"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts513" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts514">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I said, “Okay, that’s close to home, so they can’t say anything about, ‘Oh, we can’t get you home,’ because I can catch a ride home.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a190"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts515" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts516">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And in fact, many times I did.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a191"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts517" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts518">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I caught rides with people.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a192"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts519" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts520">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um there was a board in um the student union building where they could post, you know, “I’m going such and such, anybody want a ride?”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a193"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts521" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts522">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I would go and look on that board, and you know it worked out.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a194"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts523" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts524">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I- I met people who were- were from Daytona I never knew, but I had made their acquaintance .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a195"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts525" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts526">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And it turned out to be a win-win deal.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a196"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts528" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts530">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Later on, some of my teachers came over here for a master’s, and I would go home with them —you know, in my senior year.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a197"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts531" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts532">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, it was good. It was good, yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a198"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts534" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts536">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So my daughter, um when she was a baby uh, I always —I brainwashed her.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a199"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts538" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts540">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Into being a Gator, because that's all she ever heard when she was—I married someone here locally, but um divorced early in her life.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a200"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts541" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts542">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But she came over here constantly for different holidays and in the summer, and she would always be brought out here to Gator stuff.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a201"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts543" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts544">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And she has a cousin who’s a cheerleader.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a202"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts545" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts546">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Robin Griffin, who was a cheerleader in the 80s.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a203"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts547" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts548">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh went here, you know, got a degree from here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a204"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts549" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts550">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Would bring her out here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a205"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts551" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts552">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And uh her father would bring her out here to watch the scrimmages and all that kind of stuff.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a206"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts553" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts554">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So she was a Gator way before she really had a chance to make a-!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a207"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts556" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts558">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, she didn’t have a chance.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a208"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts560" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts562">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, she had a very different experience.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a209"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts563" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts564">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She enjoyed it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a210"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts570" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts572">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well um, now she- she- she felt like, honest to goodness, that the system was hostile.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a211"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts574" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts576">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She said they're out to flunk you day one!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a212"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts578" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts580">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Not because she was Black, but because they’re trying to weed people out.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a213"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts582" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts584">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She um- well, when she first came, she was thinking about Business.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a214"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts585" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts586">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then it was Physical Therapy.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a215"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts587" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts588">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She finally majored in Speech Pathology.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a216"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts590" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts592">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Turned out to be a very good choice.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a217"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts593" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts594">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Very good choice.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a218"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts595" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts596">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um next week, she’s opening her own clinic.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a219"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts598" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts600">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. So, that- that was very productive.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a220"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts602" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts604">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It wasn't- It wasn’t that this one per se, it’s the system.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a221"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts606" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts608">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The system.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a222"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts609" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts610">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She said it's- it’s very- it's very cold .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a223"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts611" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts612">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Cold and impersonal.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a224"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts613" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts614">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um...It’s, like, set up to knock so many kids out, you know, the freshman year.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a225"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts615" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts616">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You kinda weed it down so that um by the time they have to choose a college, they have fewer people to deal with.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a226"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts617" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts618">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But she- she found it an unfriendly system.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a227"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts619" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts620">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But, you know, she prospered.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a228"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts621" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts622">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She did fine.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a229"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts623" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts624">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um, she- she got her bachelor ’s.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a230"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts625" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts626">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She was- just- just got started to get over the fact that she wasn't admitted to grad school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a231"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts627" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts628">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She was really POed about that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a232"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts629" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts630">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She said, “I’m one of their own.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a233"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts631" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts632">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn’t come here from someplace else.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a234"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts633" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts634">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I came here as a freshman.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a235"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts635" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts636">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I duked it out that whole time, you know, got my degree; I should’ ve been given priority, not somebody from Kalamazoo.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a236"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts637" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts638">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I don’t know, I think they have reasons for letting other people in, and sending most of their kids other places.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a237"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts639" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts640">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I’m not sure what it all abouts, but, you know I always- it was a very uneasy time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a238"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts641" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts642">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But she received her master’s from Howard University, which is a Black school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a239"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts643" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts644">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And a very good school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a240"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts646" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts648">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. And what I- what I said to her was, you know, it was divine intervention.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a241"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts649" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts650">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was your opportunity to see the best of both worlds, and you’re the better for it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a242"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts651" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts652">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And she did. She said it was a different atmosphere there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a243"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts653" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts654">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was a more loving atmosphere, it was a smaller, uh just warm, “I’ll help you ,” fuzzy kind of thing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a244"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts656" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts658">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right. But, she said, “If you can make it at Florida, you can make it at anywhere, make it anywhere.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a245"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts659" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts660">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because she said you’re on your own at Florida!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a246"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts661" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts662">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, you know I said it was just in preparation for what you needed to do in graduate school, which was to work all day for a grade and then go to classes at night.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a247"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts663" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts664">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, she did well.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a248"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts665" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts666">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh, she’s had um managerial jobs, um she was able to move all about the country, you know um working in um geriatric- with the geriatric populations —which is what she prefers, but you know she could work at schools or whatever.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a249"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts667" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts668">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um a year ago, she and three- um two other ladies formed a company for speech and language services, and so they’ re opening their clinic uh after one year, uh this week, and they've—</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a250"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts670" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts672">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>—Really extended their clientele to uh early uh intervention, uh geriatric, as well as schools.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a251"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts673" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts674">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So…</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a252"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts676" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts678">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a253"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts680" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts682">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um she- she really didn’t comment on- on it, but she never said that she was invited to join anything.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a254"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts683" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts684">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I don’t think she did join anything.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a255"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts685" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts686">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um it was basically going to class. She got a job, she worked at the library.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a256"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts687" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts688">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Same thing that I did, uh worked in the library.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a257"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts689" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts690">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>At one point she was working at —I don’t know, maybe working for SGA or something in the reception area.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a258"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts691" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts692">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um worked different little jobs along the way.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a259"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts693" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts694">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But, she didn’t make a comment.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a260"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts702" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts704">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um…the- the only thing, I’ve been a little POed, and I’m not exactly who to aim- aim- sure who to aim it at.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a261"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts705" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts706">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But, okay: this is my third year coming to this particular activity, but when announcements or when the cards are sent out about it, they send them to my daughter.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a262"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts708" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts710">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, they just send them to my daughter.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a263"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts711" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts712">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because you know she was a student here, too.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a264"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts713" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts714">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It’s like they don’t know I’m living.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a265"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts715" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts716">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I- and every year, I fill out some papers, and I’m saying, “Okay, what’s going on here?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a266"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts717" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts718">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Is somebody asleep on the job?”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a267"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts719" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts720">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then, uh also, I found out that the College of Education had some kind of activity at the president’s house uh yesterday.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a268"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts721" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts722">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I received no notice about that, and both of my degrees are in Education.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a269"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts723" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts724">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so…Right. And my niece received one, the one that was a former cheerleader.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a270"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts725" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts726">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And um my friend received another notice for I think October, for Homecoming, about some other activity.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a271"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts727" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts728">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I’m going, “Okay, uh I know they have my name somewhere, because they send me the publications and other things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a272"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts729" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts730">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, what is the deal?”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a273"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts734" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts736">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, I need to get to the bottom of that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a274"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts740" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts742">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>One other thing that concerns me: the number of friends that I know that —and people that I met —that say, “ I’m a Florida graduate, I’m a Gator ,” but they don’t- they don't come here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a275"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts743" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts744">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They don’t do this.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a276"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts745" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts746">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They don’t —I realize getting a ticket to the game is hard, but they don’t try to come back to the university .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a277"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts747" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts748">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I don’t quite understand what the dynamics —.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a278"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts750" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts752">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In general, as anything.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a279"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts753" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts754">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And, I don’t know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a280"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts755" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts756">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>When I talk to some of them, some of them express the feeling of being maybe ostracized or left out .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a281"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts757" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts758">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And, “Yeah, I went to school there, but I don’t see anything —.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a282"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts759" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts760">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Whatever. And I don’t know, I don’t understand that because I said well you know, I went to school there, too; and even though I didn’t belong to a club and stuff, I still know that I’m a Gator .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a283"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts761" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts762">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I still love being in Gainesville, I love being on campus, and I think about all the happy things that happened to me there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a284"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts763" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts764">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I said, did somebody beat you across the head, or hurt your feelings or something?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a285"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts765" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts766">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know? But I don’t know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a286"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts767" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts768">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It’s- It's some kind of feeling, and I don’t know how to get —</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a287"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts772" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts774">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a288"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts775" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts776">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so, it saddens me, because I'm looking around I'm saying, “Okay, where are the people from my generation?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a289"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts777" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts778">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I’d like to see them.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a290"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts779" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts780">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know. I’ve even tried to find some of them on Facebook.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a291"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts782" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts784">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know. I found one- I found one guy, and um just as I started a little dialogue with him, all of the sudden the curtains came down.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a292"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts785" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts786">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don’t know if his um wife, or I don’t know what happened; but all of the sudden, he started- I started to see more details about the family.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a293"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts787" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts788">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I say, “Okay, that’s fine.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a294"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts789" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts790">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>All I want to know is, have you talked to So-and-so?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a295"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts791" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts792">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know. Have you seen any of our old crowd?”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a296"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts793" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts794">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I didn’t- I didn't get too far on that because, you know…</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a297"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts802" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts804">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, that’s the beauty of it!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a298"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts805" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts806">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I was saying, “Oh, boy!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a299"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts807" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts808">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Now I can find out what happened to all of those guys.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a300"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts809" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts810">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But you know, one guy that was very um uh very active socially here, um I found him at the University of California at Northridge; he’s a professor there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a301"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts811" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts812">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>He’s a uh very um uh—he’s a social activist .</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a302"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts813" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts814">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I- I found him, emailed him, called him; he called me back.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a303"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts815" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts816">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We had a conversation- about a three hour conversation on the phone one day, and then I never heard from him again.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a304"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts817" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts818">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I tried to beep him again, say, “Okay.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a305"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts819" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts820">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because I keep saying, “You don’t come to the reunions; come to the reunions.”</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a306"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts821" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts822">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But it’s been a few months now, and I haven’t heard from him, so.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a307"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts823" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts824">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don’t know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
    </TIER>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="praat" PARTICIPANT="Matthew White" TIER_ID="Interviewer">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a308"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>All right, I’m going to pull up a little closer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a309"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts3" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts4">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we are recording.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a310"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts5" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts7">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If you could repeat for me your name?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a311"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts9" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts11">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay. And how long- when did you attend the University of Florida?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a312"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts15" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts17">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, in what subjects?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a313"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts21" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts23">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay. Um and so, could one assume, then, that you worked with the Education school?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a314"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts25" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts26">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay. Um and um where are you from-where were you from when you went to school?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a315"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts27" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts29">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We’ll start with that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a316"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts31" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts33">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Do you still live there?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a317"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts35" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts37">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And you went right back to Daytona Beach.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a318"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts39" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts40">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay. Um and uh if you could first for just a moment, in sort of a general way, reflect um your experiences at UF.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a319"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts41" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts43">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It sounds like you were here for —I didn’t do the math in my head; about four years, sounds standard.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a320"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts45" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts47">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, okay. From where?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a321"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts53" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts54">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay. Now, that-that strikes me as-as an American generalist, that’s a very interesting time in American educational history um for colleges.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
